@base=http://localhost:3000
### Health
GET {{base}}/health
### Login mock user (trả về accessToken)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.com","password":"Demo@12345"}
### Đăng ký
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Nguyễn Văn A","email":"new@example.com","password":"Password123!"}
### Danh sách users (Admin token, thay YOUR_TOKEN)
GET {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
### Lấy user theo id
GET {{base}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
### Cập nhật
PUT {{base}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Tên mới"}
### Xóa (Admin)
DELETE {{base}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
